{"pageProps":{"meta":{"id":"obsidian:2026-10-30-official-0c09b8d1f7f7","title":"腾讯开源 WeVisCut：9B 编辑智能体如何把稿子变成多分钟成片","date":"2026-10-30","updated":"2026-10-30","summary":"腾讯开源 WeVisCut：9B 编辑智能体如何把稿子变成多分钟成片","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-新锐模型","name":"新锐模型","color":"default"}],"image":"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-30-official-0c09b8d1f7f7/wordmark-wide-92f99d0dda98.jpg","coverBlockId":null,"slug":"2026-10-30-official-0c09b8d1f7f7","legacyPaths":[],"lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"model","discoveryName":"WeVisCut","discoveryCategory":"AI大模型","discoveryStage":"官方发布","discoveryUrl":"https://huggingface.co/tencent/WeVisCut","source":"markdown","fixedProductFooter":true},"markdownHtml":"<p>写完一篇文章或者一段解说稿之后，最花时间的往往不是写，而是把它变成一条能发出去的成片：找画面、配旁白、对时间线、导出。腾讯在 Hugging Face 上新放出的 tencent/WeVisCut 想接的就是这段活——它不是文生视频模型，而是一个 9B 的工具调用智能体，每读一次当前剪辑状态，就从 12 个工具里挑一个来用。</p>\n<p>官方模型页对它的定位写得很直接：把知识文章或解说脚本变成多分钟的成片视频。每一步要么规划、要么写旁白、要么检索素材、要么合成、要么检查、要么修复。这 12 个工具像是剪辑台上的几排按钮，模型扮演的是那个坐在台前、知道下一步该按哪个的人。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-30-official-0c09b8d1f7f7/source-evidence-1-279ac575.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/6436d7a5f8fd3be92aa5c93f-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/6436d7a5f8fd3be92aa5c93f-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-30-official-0c09b8d1f7f7/source-evidence-1-279ac575.png\" alt=\"官方模型页摘要\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It is not a standalone text-to-video model; use it with the WeVisCut runtime, which executes the model’s tool calls.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>这句话是使用它之前必须先看懂的一点：模型权重单独下载下来并不能直接吐出一条视频，它需要 WeVisCut 运行时来真正执行它发出的工具调用。用日常的说法，这就像买了一个会写菜谱的厨师，但他做菜要的锅灶和灶台，得由另外一套厨房系统提供。权重是“大脑”，运行时才是那间厨房。</p>\n<h2>权重放在哪、基座是谁</h2>\n<p>模型页标注的模型规模是 9B 参数，张量类型为 BF16，采用 Safetensors 格式，模型树显示它的基座是 Qwen/Qwen3.5-9B-Base，属于在 Qwen3.5-9B 基础上做的微调。官方描述称其策略基于 Qwen3.5-9B，并在可执行的剪辑轨迹上训练。也就是说它的“剪辑直觉”来自看过的操作序列，而不是靠推理时临时猜。</p>\n<p>许可方面分成两块，需要分开看：代码以 Apache License 2.0 发布；模型权重与第三方组件则各自遵循其对应的许可条款。这个划分在实践中很关键——代码部分可以宽松地拿去改，权重能不能商用、能不能再分发，要按权重仓库的许可单独确认，不能从代码的宽松直接推过去。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-30-official-0c09b8d1f7f7/source-evidence-5-b54e5ca0.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/90a215a424b84789d1ae3416-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/90a215a424b84789d1ae3416-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-30-official-0c09b8d1f7f7/source-evidence-5-b54e5ca0.png\" alt=\"官方许可说明\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<h2>本地跑起来需要什么</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-30-official-0c09b8d1f7f7/source-evidence-2-1280dc54.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/3e0e22035e1abc445f38944a-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/3e0e22035e1abc445f38944a-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-30-official-0c09b8d1f7f7/source-evidence-2-1280dc54.png\" alt=\"官方部署要求\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>官方给出的部署要求是：Python 3.11 或更高版本，一块大约 24GB 显存的英伟达 GPU 用于 bf16 推理，并且要先装好与本机 CUDA 版本匹配的 PyTorch。安装脚本会顺带装上 Node.js、FFmpeg 和渲染器。整体流程是克隆仓库、装 requirements 和 requirements-gpu、跑 setup 脚本，再用 huggingface_hub 把 tencent/WeVisCut 下载到 checkpoints/weviscut-9b，最后 bash run_studio.sh 启动，打开 8081 端口进 Studio。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">git clone https://github.com/Tencent/WeVisCut.git\ncd WeVisCut\npip install -r requirements.txt\npip install -r requirements-gpu.txt\nbash scripts/setup_external_tools.sh\npip install -U &quot;huggingface_hub[cli]&quot;\nhf download tencent/WeVisCut --local-dir checkpoints/weviscut-9b\nbash run_studio.sh\n</code></pre>\n<p>如果只想先看看界面长什么样，官方还留了一条轻量入口：bash run_studio.sh --no-model，不加载任何模型权重就跑起 Studio。这对想先判断这套剪辑流程合不合自己口味的人比较友好，不用先腾出一块 24GB 显卡。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-30-official-0c09b8d1f7f7/source-evidence-3-07446bcd.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/877746f4f0418af6a9a29fe2-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/877746f4f0418af6a9a29fe2-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-30-official-0c09b8d1f7f7/source-evidence-3-07446bcd.png\" alt=\"官方运行时能力说明\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<h2>它实际交付的是什么体验</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-30-official-0c09b8d1f7f7/source-evidence-4-4ea8a8cd.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/877746f4f0418af6a9a29fe2-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/877746f4f0418af6a9a29fe2-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-30-official-0c09b8d1f7f7/source-evidence-4-4ea8a8cd.png\" alt=\"官方成片质量说明\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>运行时的能力被描述为：提供可编辑的时间线，支持暂停与继续、手动修改和对话式修改、逐镜头重渲染，以及版本回滚。这几项决定了这东西到底能不能进日常流程——可以停下来手动改一版、改坏了退回上一个版本，而不是只能从头跑一遍等它出结果。</p>\n<p>官方也明确承认成片质量取决于外部配置：检索服务、TTS 服务、渲染服务以及可用模板。也就是说“稿子变视频”这件事里，模型负责决定怎么剪、往哪配，而素材从哪来、声音怎么念、最终画面怎么合成，取决于你给它接了哪些服务。服务没配好，模型再聪明也变不出成片。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-30-official-0c09b8d1f7f7/source-evidence-6-355acd5a.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/30ba2ead09a28f607cb30ac9-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/30ba2ead09a28f607cb30ac9-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-30-official-0c09b8d1f7f7/source-evidence-6-355acd5a.png\" alt=\"官方托管支持状态\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>警告</strong>\n官方在“预期用途与限制”里写明：它面向长视频剪辑的研究与生产辅助，不保证事实准确性或制作质量，发布前需人工审看生成的旁白与视频。这条限制值得单独记住——它是负责干活的助手，不是可以不看就发出去的自动机。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>此外，模型页显示当前还没有任何 Inference Provider 部署这个模型，页面上挂着“请求提供方支持”的入口。想省事走托管 API 的路，眼下暂时没有现成选项，自建是主要路径。</p>\n<h2>什么时候值得试</h2>\n<p>如果你的日常产出是那种“稿子已经写好、只差剪成一条”的内容，这个项目值得放进候选：它把剪辑动作拆成 12 个可调用的步骤，并且留了暂停、回滚和逐镜头重渲染这些工程上的余地。配套的论文是 arXiv:2610.38352，标题为“WeVisCut: The Whole Editing Room in One Agent From Narration to Long-Form Video”，模型页显示该论文为两天前发布。</p>\n<p>如果你的显卡达不到 24GB 显存，或者你更想要一个开箱即用的在线服务，那现在不是合适的入手时机——前者是硬门槛，后者目前没有可用的托管提供方。最省事的验证路径是先跑 --no-model 模式看 Studio 的时间线交互合不合手，再决定要不要为一块显卡投入。</p>\n<p>模型页还给出了项目仓库地址，代码在 Apache License 2.0 之下，权重与第三方组件按各自许可执行，需要商用或再分发的人应当以权重仓库的许可条款为准。</p>\n<h2>官方资料</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/tencent/WeVisCut\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://huggingface.co/tencent/WeVisCut\">腾讯混元 官方发布说明</a></li>\n</ul>\n","relatedPosts":[{"id":"obsidian:2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086","rawId":"obsidian:2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086","slug":"2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086","legacyPaths":[],"title":"腾讯WeMM-Video-9B能同时看画面、听原声，接入前要准备什么？","date":"2026-11-22","updated":"2026-11-22","summary":"官方已列出权重与部署方法，但视频原声需要明确接入，运行环境也有补丁要求。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-新锐模型","name":"新锐模型","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086/wordmark-wide-05acad5ce433.jpg","cover":"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086/wordmark-wide-05acad5ce433.jpg","source":"markdown","status":"published","lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"model","discoveryName":"WeMM-Video-9B","discoveryCategory":"AI大模型","discoveryStage":"官方发布","discoveryUrl":"https://huggingface.co/tencent/WeMM-Video-9B","sourcePath":"posts/2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086.md","fixedProductFooter":true},{"id":"obsidian:2026-11-22-official-54156d2227e5","rawId":"obsidian:2026-11-22-official-54156d2227e5","slug":"2026-11-22-official-54156d2227e5","legacyPaths":[],"title":"腾讯WeMM-Video能连画面带声音理解视频，部署前该看哪些条件？","date":"2026-11-22","updated":"2026-11-22","summary":"腾讯WeMM-Video能连画面带声音理解视频，部署前该看哪些条件？","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-新锐模型","name":"新锐模型","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-22-official-54156d2227e5/wordmark-wide-bae77126e5e7.jpg","cover":"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-22-official-54156d2227e5/wordmark-wide-bae77126e5e7.jpg","source":"markdown","status":"published","lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"model","discoveryName":"WeMM-Video-35BA3B","discoveryCategory":"AI大模型","discoveryStage":"官方发布","discoveryUrl":"https://huggingface.co/tencent/WeMM-Video-35BA3B","sourcePath":"posts/2026-11-22-official-54156d2227e5.md","fixedProductFooter":true},{"id":"obsidian:2026-11-21-official-6a1fa8a670ef","rawId":"obsidian:2026-11-21-official-6a1fa8a670ef","slug":"2026-11-21-official-6a1fa8a670ef","legacyPaths":[],"title":"腾讯WeMM-Video-4B能结合画面与原声理解视频，部署前要确认什么？","date":"2026-11-21","updated":"2026-11-21","summary":"腾讯WeMM-Video-4B能结合画面与原声理解视频，部署前要确认什么？","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-新锐模型","n